My main advice would be to play it slow; if you see something new stay
calm.  Remember that most YASD's could have been prevented with an
item from a bag or even in open inventory.  Also, since you mention
having a lot of scrolls and potions, make sure that you're
unburdened.  Set up a stash somewhere or use some of your scrolls and
potions.  I'd recommend having teleportitis and teleport control as
they let you escape from a lot of situations and teleport control will
also allow you to use the Orb's levelport ability more reliably.

